            "review_title": "Review at Cá Nhảy Seafood",
            "review_text": "jordan a\n3 contributions\n0\nPredatory pricing for tourists, please be cautious\nAug 2025 • Couples\nPlease be aware this place is a scam! Avoid avoid avoid!\n\nThe prices they charge are purposely unclear. Our bill came to 1,000,000 VND which was shocking for two people. Especially considering the amount of food they served. For example we had 10 tiny mussels, 1 tiny crab, a tiny amount of squid and one tiny fish.\n\nThe good news is that my bank has blocked this payment and it will be reverted.\n\nPlease traveler’s be warned of this shady restaurant and their predatory pricing tactics.\n\nThey also charge extra to sit in air conditioning which should have been a red flag warning already!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 4, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
