            "review_title": "Review at Cá Nhảy Seafood",
            "review_text": "Bruce M\nWellington, New Zealand129 contributions\n0\nWent away hungry :-(\nJun 2025 • Couples\nAfter 2 weeks of Asian food, was keen to try the Western menu at this place...\n\nThe setting was nice, and TBH the food was tasty, but without a word of a lie my fish meal came with only TEN tiny French fries. \n\nWhen pushed, the manager offered a 5% discount. Around $1.\nAnd the waitress offered lots of apologies...\n\nThey just don't get it....\nRead more\nWritten June 3, 2025",
